  "body": "Stacked on #1996 (merge #1996 first)\n\n## What changed\n- Expose cursor row selection with AccessKit `set_selected` in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/gcode_view.rs`.\n- Wrap `pages::properties` in a `Role::Pane` node labelled `\"Properties\"` in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/pages.rs`.\n- Expose `.alt_text(tex.name())` on tool icon images in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tool_icons.rs`.\n- Remove size, colour, and fixed pointer clauses from behaviour tests in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests.rs`, `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/fixtures_page.rs`, `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/gcode_viewer.rs`, `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/tool_icon_wiring.rs`, `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/edge_click_modifiers.rs`, and `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/geo_row_hover.rs`.\n- Move the size, alignment, and non-wrapping layout checks into `layout_page_setup_fixtures_mark` and `layout_window_gcode_wrap_and_trace` in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/page_layout.rs`.\n- Record the unattended design choices in `docs/decisions/1990-ui-behaviour-no-look.md`.\n\n## Cause\nBehaviour tests checked fill colours, rect coordinates, widget widths, and fixed `pos2(1.0, 1.0)` pointer points instead of AccessKit roles, labels, selection state, and live layout anchors. Layout refits broke behaviour tests that asserted visual layout.\n\n## Tests\n- Pins (red before fix): `gcode_viewer` (`the_cursor_line_is_highlighted`, `a_click_pin_does_not_outlive_its_listing`, `a_same_length_new_listing_does_not_inherit_the_pin`), `tool_icon_wiring` (`every_catalog_row_paints_its_kind_glyph`, `every_picker_item_paints_its_kind_glyph`), and `tests::every_registry_kind_gets_its_tab_bar`.\n- Mutation results: reverting each new AccessKit addition in `gcode_view.rs`, `tool_icons.rs`, or `pages.rs` broke the matching pinning tests (`FAILED`); restoring each change made all pins pass (`PASSED`).\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed on `67a0f08c`: `camcraft-ui --lib` 863 passed, 0 failed, 6 ignored; `boundary` 3 passed; `boundary_picks` 6 passed; `sinker_setup` 2 passed; `tap_hand` 3 passed; `theme_files` 14 passed; `waterjet_tool` 1 passed.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed on `67a0f08c` with zero warnings.\n- `crates/ui` `#[test]` attribute count is 1004 (`+1` net over `#1996`).\n\n## Goldens moved\nnone\n\n## Not exercised\n- Workspace crates outside the quick-gate UI plan (`geometry`, `kernel`, `cl`, `tools`, `post`, `sim`, `motion`, `app`).\n- The 6 `#[ignore]` tests in `camcraft-ui --lib` and UI integration binaries not named by the `ui` gate map.\n\n## Overlaps\n- Stacked on `#1996` (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests.rs`, `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/page_layout.rs`, `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/anchors.rs`); merge `#1996` first.\n- `#2068` (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/page_layout.rs`, `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests.rs`): touches different functions (`layout_window_gcode` vs our `layout_window_gcode_wrap_and_trace`); whichever merges second refreshes.\n- `#2081` (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/fixtures_page.rs`, `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests.rs`): touches different functions (`the_fixtures_page_is_laid_out_in_groups_like_the_wcs_page` vs our `the_fixtures_page_offers_mark_for_exactly_one_selected_model`); whichever merges second refreshes.\n- `#1701` (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/geo_row_hover.rs`): touches a different function; whichever merges second refreshes.\n- `#1209`, `#1717`, and `#1931` (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/pages.rs`): touch `properties_body` (different lines from our `properties` wrapper); whichever merges second refreshes.\n- `#1330`, `#1685`, `#1753`, `#1938`, `#2023`, `#2027`, `#2036`, `#2077`, `#2078`, and `#2086` (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests.rs`): touch different functions from `pane_texts`; whichever merges second refreshes.\n\nChangelog: none\nFixes #1990\n\nProcess change: yes\n\n## Before and after screenshots\n\nThese images show the Properties pane with `EM-0600-4FL` selected.\nBoth images use the current upstream tool fields at 1280 × 720.\nThe before image omits the Properties AccessKit wrapper from this PR.\nThe after image includes that wrapper.\nThe pixels are the same because the wrapper changes accessibility data.\nThe images are stored only on the fork's `pr-screenshots` branch at `067aa38dcbbff58be5ca32db3125da9c89355cd3`.\n\n![Before: Properties pane without the AccessKit wrapper](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/067aa38dcbbff58be5ca32db3125da9c89355cd3/2090/properties-before.png)\n\n![After: Properties pane with the AccessKit wrapper](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/067aa38dcbbff58be5ca32db3125da9c89355cd3/2090/properties-after.png)\n",
